# =========================
# Support Access — owner-side signing key (Phase 4d)
# =========================
# The private key's default location is entirely outside this repository (see
# tools/README.md — os.homedir()/StudixSupport by default). These narrow rules guard only
# against it accidentally ending up inside tools/ (e.g. a misconfigured
# STUDIX_SUPPORT_KEY_DIR pointing into the repo) — scoped to tools/ specifically, not a
# blanket *.pem/*.key rule, so a legitimately-committed public artifact elsewhere in the
# repo is never silently hidden. Nothing under tools/ is ever meant to hold a real key file
# either way — support-keygen.js only ever writes to the external owner-controlled directory.
tools/**/*.pem
tools/**/*.key
tools/StudixSupport/

# Phase 5d — Licensing owner-side signing key. Completely separate keypair/directory from
# Support Access above (StudixLicensing, not StudixSupport) — same reasoning, same narrow
# scope (tools/**/*.pem and tools/**/*.key above already cover this directory name too;
# this explicit line is redundant defense-in-depth, matching the Support Access entry).
tools/StudixLicensing/